{"id":"wb-7-1447","name":"栗川砖塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"栗川砖塔","text":"栗川砖塔，又名栗川白塔，为北宋淳化年间所建白塔寺之佛塔，位于中国甘肃省徽县栗川乡郇庄村，是一个全国重点文物保护单位，类型为宋代建筑，道光年间重修时为八方十二级，高约六丈广一丈五尺，光绪五年地震只存九级。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A0%97%E5%B7%9D%E7%A0%96%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86761366,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86761366","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9112c9eca8c02c607d298210.jpg","title":"栗川砖塔.jpeg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%A0%97%E5%B7%9D%E7%A0%96%E5%A1%94.jpeg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/%E6%A0%97%E5%B7%9D%E7%A0%96%E5%A1%94.jpeg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"自己的作品","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"​位于甘肃省徽县栗川镇郇庄村","width":320,"height":427}}